<title>THAILAND: Thailand says Philippines to buy Thai rice.</title>
<headline>Thailand says Philippines to buy Thai rice.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines is to buy 205,000 tonnes of 25 percent grade Thai rice, Foreign Minister Prachuab Chaiyasarn said on Thursday after returning from a trip to Manila.</p>
<p>Prachuab did not provide details on prices and shipment but said the deal would be on cash basis and not be a part of any countertrade arrangement.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
